WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:04.100
My name is Logan.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.300
I may be able to help you find some answers.

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:08.780
Who am I?

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:09.740
I know how special you are.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.940
I come with you, I'm coming for blood.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:13.763
Are you ready...

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:14.560
- No law...

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.880
...to do what you need to do?

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:16.780
No code of conduct...

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:17.520
Hunt him down.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.720
You want to shoot me, SHOOT ME!

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.340
They did to me what I am.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.640
I can't be undone

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.160
You are different now. They can hurt you.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.540
A lot of people have tried to kill me. But I'm still here.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.780
You have struggled long enough, Logan.

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:41.280
Right now, I'm feeling unbelievable gratitude

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:45.340
that this part happened to come into my life.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.240
What you have with Wolverine and his back story

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:52.960
and an actor of power of Hugh Jackman playing him

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.420
is unique among other superhero films.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:59.320
Wolverine and Hugh Jackman cannot now be separated.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.220
The man and the role have merged.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:12.240
He has found a way to connect a deep part of himself to this character.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.160
Ladies and gentlemen, HUGH JACKMAN!

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:23.500
This is going to be my last time I'll be putting on claws. One. Last. Time.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:31.640
This is what life looks like... Feel it... You still have time.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:37.900
What's so wonderful about Hugh is that he is hungry to go deeper and darker than he has ever been before.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:45.520
Because this is Hugh's last movie, as this character, I wanted to make sure NOT that it's his last movie, but that it's his best movie.

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:50.320
And CUT! We got it!

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:58.100
It's a really surreal day. I've got my 16 year old in the trailer, who was not even born when I started playing this part.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:04.780
No movie has meant more to me than this movie. From the bottom of my heart, thank you so much for helping us realize this dream.

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:07.960
I am grateful to things in a big way

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:13.860
and I consider it a great, great privilege to have had the chance to play this character.

